  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">For most food and beverage organizations, there's an existing mentality that integrating technology into business is complicated and invasive, but avoiding technology will only make it harder to compete in the future.</p>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Adding technology to the shop floor is only as complicated as the company makes it. Start by rolling out simple things, phase-wise, so employees can become familiar with the system. Once that becomes a natural part of your operation, more can be added and customized to increase your efficiency.</p>

